      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">7. “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">AI DOes the Work for Me</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a2056934-c30e-4a74-8c1c-10d3806bfc1e">
      <Text>CherRY, PERRY, SHELBY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a225cb2c-2604-4341-a547-e66f091c4e69">
      <Text>Who will do the hard work?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="28a5de5f-38c0-46f0-915d-757f6151fc4b">
      <Text>WayLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="36a7bd72-05f3-4572-9ba9-2370f0817711">
      <Text>A I!!!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="357c6346-b072-488a-b044-1de84a800e01">
      <Text>Wayland releases a bunch of physical embodiments of AI slop.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c156e8b3-ae34-4df4-910e-83e71787e95a">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">VandaMS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="24005342-bc6c-4ced-9c91-31be6f402649">
      <Text>That is crazy!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b95b62b0-f059-47d2-a7d2-faecd0e7348d">
      <Text>Wayland</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="4f5e49da-760a-4e43-b914-b8d4467397e7">
      <Text>Listen, freaks. I’m not your enemy!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cad0d94c-6c7c-43bc-9b88-c92f6db9df34">
      <Text>[Wayland explains the power of a data center.]</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="abcd7fdf-c586-4ac6-99c2-d8ce225d9abe">
      <Text>Wayland</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="deb91a21-910e-4edf-963a-16a2478b1a23">
      <Text>Don’t miss this great opportunity!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6e40c95e-3b0d-49c9-b231-84b0295acbd4">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Vandams</Text>
      <Text> except Cherry</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="19b7eafc-3bb9-46ae-bf21-b7baea6c53a6">
      <Text>It’s free?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4cd5155a-98dd-4083-b08c-4928ecbfbaf2">
      <Text>WayLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="ce6dd199-d0e2-40cd-9c49-e3e7a690dd04">
      <Text>So free.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1ba9c039-723e-446d-9f83-4cd96b419dc2">
      <Text>Cherry</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="c3682704-7d81-41da-876e-2eb036efafb2">
      <Text>This is slavery.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dab0f89a-8883-4a97-ad85-222af5c1e277">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">VandaMS</Text>
      <Text> EXCEPT CHERRY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="fe7700cb-b9b9-4343-a85d-9ae8c4fff899">
      <Text>Really?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="98140634-9747-4bea-9417-2c1dc7af4766">
      <Text>WaylAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="c3cf3a72-da0a-46b7-8ce5-c8d43a1f92a3">
      <Text>But dirt cheap!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fa3dbe9d-efb5-44f5-9b8d-a0d9d4b14ef3">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">VandAMS</Text>
      <Text> eXCEPT CHERRY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="65c2750b-5547-43ab-b9c5-8ce8e52538df">
      <Text>Let’s cheat!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="999006b5-f907-4ef2-aac2-c24054795010">
      <Text>CheRRY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="46c57695-b877-4da5-93ed-d0bb31c78699">
      <Text>The bill for electricity?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d729f8fd-71a3-4beb-a45b-fa6a261a80a0">
      <Text>WayLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="0197f6fd-9586-41d2-af25-5d89fa298041">
      <Text>Speaking of city!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b1b9bb0e-5e8c-4119-b939-a5c5bebad03d">
      <Text>[There is a montage of Wayland stealing away every home in every city in Michigan.]</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fbebdc94-ec09-4729-a980-7dfe58c83b24">
      <Text>WayLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="47a5b297-d6cb-4edd-a0d6-ae88d2022517">
      <Text>Ai’s doing the work for me!
I’ll make history with data centers in all cities!
AI may grow a conscience before anyone of us will realize...
Oh well...

AI’s gonna make me lotsa money!
I’ll make history with data centers in all cities!
Maybe I will grow a conscience before anyone of you spread lies...
No way...
Ai does the work for me!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="eb856690-b1a3-4f35-8b5f-8c2819a62116">
      <Text Style="Underline">End of “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">AI Does the Work for Me</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c146a5a0-71ba-4970-8ccf-ca5f241922bf">
      <Text>PetoSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9123d2ca-3b50-4692-91bc-6e006f33231e">
      <Text>Wow... Yas, Kween!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f541bd3d-48d1-4493-a1dd-c7d198f210e3">
      <Text>Jacob slaps Petoskey’s shoulder.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a692f322-a375-462b-85a6-f853d678062a">
      <Text>JacoB</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="30020339-3a29-4229-9bf6-5e358d1ac5bf">
      <Text>Don’t use “Kween” in a straight way ever again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3b228dbc-a315-477d-8782-efd719bb11bf">
      <Text>WayLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c43fdb94-ee2c-4129-a6fa-c2bc4bd7fe17">
      <Text>As your “Kween,” I am entitled to a tour of your shanty palace.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7b2a2a06-440e-48e7-873e-e46d38797043">
      <Text>Cherry is about to lead Wayland.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6966c4a7-fe0d-420a-9274-1d5e6a2b61c9">
      <Text>Wayland</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c18faddd-6d98-48f4-be95-1a127485226a">
      <Text>No </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">no</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">no</Text>
      <Text>. I only give access to those who show a little respect. Pebble?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="359d4585-6584-4560-9f2d-7fc02e671663">
      <Text>PetoSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d15a2ca9-b965-4514-8afb-3fb1088a94e0">
      <Text>Petoskey.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cee35bb1-960f-4d64-8540-60261181f31e">
      <Text>WAYLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="da1c343f-b554-4bbb-ae4a-6bca6d1a5cc6">
      <Text>Okay. Crystal.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="de1815ce-2dc1-4852-991d-7b8edd522f3c">
      <Text>PETOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d5681ba2-0d28-411a-aa2b-75f803a63ff3">
      <Text>May I bring my mom?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2cb35d71-5099-44b0-a72d-d28381535f70">
      <Text>Petoskey and Liz lead Wayland into the lake house.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="c4991dc9-c78e-42e1-985d-061b649af3c4">
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">Scene 6</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="06da4649-6b94-4082-9ec1-2b3e8a87f1ef">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="25" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LIZZIE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PETOSKEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WAYLAND">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Int. Elk Lake House in Elk Rapids, August 2022 - Evening</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="75a1fa72-6d3a-4e23-b6fb-053c6de24c84">
      <Text>The walls are full of photos.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="75a1fa72-6d3a-4e23-b6fb-053c6de24c84">
      <Text>Wayland tours the house.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ad3f5ce1-6ed2-4f3a-bcba-7cd3c4b58e0c">
      <Text>WaylaND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e90f557d-a0af-4301-9dca-3df2879d1fd7">
      <Text>My guys will help preserve these photos. Don’t you worry about it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="afbc7c84-0cf8-42ef-8c4d-ae18f17cec3f">
      <Text>LizzIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8b6ff760-ff39-455f-9865-c473da36e07c">
      <Text>You’ll give them back, right?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7cb6e565-0032-43ab-a7bb-bf9661fa875c">
      <Text>WAYLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9b62936a-8d74-44f8-ad8d-04e6459987c6">
      <Text>No. And the digital prints will be behind a paywall.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dfb12620-6ccd-4766-9a20-c78d92fb3d02">
      <Text>PetoSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0643defd-b849-4d29-b467-b365dd4a2935">
      <Text>What’s a paywall?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e10a586c-bb53-4094-b6c8-59a3529bf9a8">
      <Text>LizzIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6a6c1f60-b00e-4fab-b527-7fba1f412ff7">
      <Text>It’s the reason so many people in this state get their news from conspiracy theorists online instead of reading MLive or Detroit </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">Free</Text>
      <Text> Press.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="2b317a2f-acac-442b-b0d3-0eb725b26d30">
      <SceneProperties Length="2 1/8" Page="25" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHERRY &amp; PERRY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LIZZIE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PETOSKEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WAYLAND">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">7a. “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Life is COmplete - Reprise</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f3b964c4-9ddb-448f-8c89-c4d4cab2ba49">
      <Text>WayLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ea09fd32-dad7-4077-b907-0820378eced4">
      <Text>What’s that?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ff0af0d1-be33-4bb0-8f26-d9938be12a1c">
      <Text>LIZZIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e5c5b7be-5c40-4333-b211-6dbe1d027ebf">
      <Text>I thought you’re the know-all of capitalism.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b71587b1-ede4-4d1c-8d92-94d8bea41104">
      <Text>Wayland points at a photo of young Petoskey wearing his father’s heirloom: a heart-shaped Petoskey stone with a marking of an Elk.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c1c159e4-01de-4938-a64c-2c7b0306811b">
      <Text>WaylaND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="77b68cd8-68bd-4202-82e5-4822c77f41b1">
      <Text>No... That.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d9f43109-0a2a-474a-b873-019c603687c0">
      <Text>LIZZIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="77274a0f-1805-4c1c-8d65-9f9df24d767f">
      <Text>It’s my late husband’s heirloom.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f943be17-9dfb-41d8-917e-a122dbcabc6c">
      <Text>PetoSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d4b01792-7ebb-4367-82aa-cd1aab60a0e5">
      <Text>It’s what I’m named after.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b466be89-bbc5-4321-810c-3ba607707e91">
      <Text>WayLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e22bcf28-fbc1-47f1-a055-22eaf9e2b157">
      <Text>You outgrew it? Well, no one outgrows cool rocks, especially a Petoskey. This one seems like it’s worth a whole Great Lake. No... It’s an heirloom. Your dead husband makes this worth two Great Lakes. Unlike him, is it here?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d9f6bad4-bf69-4429-b2e9-128195d2c298">
      <Text>Cherry &amp; Perry</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a2ea9634-536a-4242-848e-0d6374b5390f">
      <Text>Somewhere...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4db242c2-852b-4ed8-9183-4123c59fa6c9">
      <Text>WayLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1ade4d08-1496-4b31-ab26-0f36f7113eb6">
      <Text>Perfect. Everything on the premise is also mine.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5a75b4cc-359a-4f36-94da-7136edf75f68">
      <Text>PetoSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a44fb65b-1900-4704-b4b7-65e2c7407c57">
      <Text>It’s not yours.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="44590c7c-6fb9-49c1-a858-eadf7b2b49f1">
      <Text>WAYLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="969ee3ec-7063-421a-ab09-bb2c20be1182">
      <Text>Your son’s trade should be in law and order.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7be37823-ff18-4fae-a05f-112f4c0701be">
      <Text>LiZZIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="25eca9c9-1e93-42ec-af12-3d8948182c3c">
      <Text>Really?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ea87482f-cab2-4dec-a54c-611a7d457288">
      <Text>WAYLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a50067dc-eb23-474f-bae5-d1310a5d679b">
      <Text>No.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="aa423a29-f038-4cbe-86e0-d0cc8356fcae">
      <Text>Petoskey</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="22cff2f1-86d4-4c23-8953-721300c08b6c">
      <Text>Grammy Milly gave it to me. It’s her last gift.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6d57a472-dd51-4b5f-a955-1fe6102d7e45">
      <Text>WAYLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d2e8a58f-d898-440d-b147-7233f2d0299e">
      <Text>How about a trade?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7764fe96-5ce1-4e14-8faf-027eb93786a1">
      <Text>PETOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dd8e5e66-36a7-4913-9306-3b9694456814">
      <Text>The house...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ffbdc0e1-5148-4dad-b1eb-6e831638408b">
      <Text>WAYLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3a971a49-ae53-4153-ab04-38c6a5f4cdbe">
      <Text>...for your cool rock. Well, produce it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="630bae53-f08a-4c62-9f90-54ef569a5a24">
      <Text>PETOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="60e4f032-1901-4020-bb2d-95d4d6dfb427">
      <Text>I wanna put on a show. I need a whole day.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="88d015d8-7463-4a62-8842-09f810b6d4d5">
      <Text>WayLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4957f5c5-dca5-41c6-a80b-90a8cfd89c60">
      <Text>Tomorrow after the Grande Parade?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e48336fd-e983-4834-9831-e9fa247a4a05">
      <Text>LizZIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="173cbe1c-d9a1-4b18-8fe7-be92e56ba52d">
      <Text>Tomorrow after the Grande Parade.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="41ccdbfb-b128-4590-84ab-04d1939bf4d1">
      <Text>WAYLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="85d68bb2-7eef-4ad3-bd0d-89076add9c70">
      <Text>Life will be complete with this cool rock.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dee25d5b-0ef9-4040-8213-93680468e586">
      <Text>Wayland departs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1997c9f1-ffd7-4235-b90c-6b6e39a3fee0">
      <Text>Petoskey</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4541bd14-2247-46ef-857d-c016b3d27dee">
      <Text>And the lake house under </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Grampy</Text>
      <Text> Willy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="eb856690-b1a3-4f35-8b5f-8c2819a62116">
      <Text Style="Underline">End of “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Life is Complete - Reprise</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8f3a2630-d128-4f64-af17-a682e9b009c8">
      <Text>LizZIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="089eeb15-ef6d-4806-a325-a420f404c252">
      <Text>Is the Petoskey back in Skandia?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d34c78ce-5997-4562-82a9-2a5e0103984d">
      <Text>PetoSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dc56c715-ab5e-435e-a59f-e51ad2f145e0">
      <Text>Closer. At the bottom of Pine River.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="422fa247-9bdf-4c0f-84b8-66d1e4f588d8">
      <Text>LiZZIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f8aea4c9-0c78-4a9a-8ea6-596d02d3cc18">
      <Text>That’s not closer. How did that happen?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8767ca1d-7a33-40ff-a4ab-74929a52acef">
      <Text>Petoskey imitates Lulu.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="83e9e905-0110-4bf7-b2e9-81e590a5ff12">
      <Text>LizZIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fc039302-6c98-471e-93fb-42962612ec81">
      <Text>Lulu?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="762b2422-1c67-4cea-a640-3ccfcbd123fe"/>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="762b2422-1c67-4cea-a640-3ccfcbd123fe">
      <Text>[They have a day to find the necklace along Pine River. Petoskey revisits a memory of him canoeing with Lulu in 2019 when she tossed his heirloom, severing his dad’s spiritual ties. Petoskey enlists the cousins to help find it, promising whoever finds the heirloom gets to decide what Petoskey wears next year. But no one finds it (“More than Fine”).</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="762b2422-1c67-4cea-a640-3ccfcbd123fe"/>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="762b2422-1c67-4cea-a640-3ccfcbd123fe">
      <Text>Later that night on a dune, Lulu and Petoskey witness deer pass by their bonfire. He wishes to see his dad while she hopes to beat Petoskey (“Dearborn”). Next day, while Perry teaches fossils to the kids (“Fossils in the Stones”), Lulu separates and discovers a deer drop off the heirloom and other rare rocks on the shore (“The Great Lakes Ballet”).</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="762b2422-1c67-4cea-a640-3ccfcbd123fe"/>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="762b2422-1c67-4cea-a640-3ccfcbd123fe">
      <Text>For Harbor Days’ parade, Broadway actor cousin Jacob </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Jacobowitz</Text>
      <Text> is the Grand Marshal. So, the theme is theatre. Petoskey dresses as </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">Oklahoma</Text>
      <Text>’s Jud Fry while Lulu plays Evan Hansen. Before marching, she shows her rare findings to the family. To spite Petoskey, she breaks his father's necklace, unaware it was their only chance to save the lake house from Wayland. The parade goes wrong as Petoskey beats up Lulu, disqualifying them for the first time (“</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Fraudway</Text>
      <Text>”). After a lecture, he runs away (“Kick Rocks”).]</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="End of Act" id="da1b48dc-a3cf-4bcf-9bdc-ed21a5117b1b">
      <Text>End of ACt I</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Label="Scene 1" Type="New Act" id="03254032-ba6b-4137-a15f-5226dbf7d214">
      <Text>Act </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">II</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="bfda984e-c564-4342-b53d-a7ca9637fe52">
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">Scene 1</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="ff2224c8-4acc-4956-867a-17fd275c56b8">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="28" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Ext. Elk Rapids, 2016 - Day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="2b317a2f-acac-442b-b0d3-0eb725b26d30">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 5/8" Page="28" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LULU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LULU &amp; PETOSKEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PETOSKEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">14. “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Hands Come in Handy</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f510e3d7-488c-483e-b598-0658cdd0a828">
      <Text>The Harbor Days talent show has a handy line-up, including 7-year-old Lulu and Petoskey.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3a93b920-dbbf-4393-a4ec-bb010801c31e">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="dc41526d-1a1d-4ad0-823a-ad3794663e28">
      <Text>Welcome to Michigan.
Are you feeling lost?
Don’t forget, friend...
To put your right palm up...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="34b8b1ba-e007-4f8a-8f03-7307e9f6a8dd">
      <Text>Petoskey</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="a32f5a21-3975-4a7d-988e-8e09672820ec">
      <Text>Or face your left hand down...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bfd01756-65f2-4325-890a-d34e3159e917">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="352471b5-371d-4d65-b90b-ee14812f08e2">
      <Text>Put your right palm up...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="70a67fb6-b91c-4200-8b81-ac508a2a7dd4">
      <Text>Petoskey</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="68cf5550-72a2-47b9-938d-2e372d731f24">
      <Text>And your left hand over...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c490727f-85fb-4af3-8554-fbabfd285572">
      <Text>Petoskey puts his left hand with palm facing over Lulu’s right hand with palm facing to form Michigan’s peninsulas.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dc232821-9747-4fa7-a8e1-1e2d2e8b0364">
      <Text>Lulu &amp; PETOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="ba281244-885c-4d4c-8aa3-405d91c159ce">
      <Text>Let’s start with the thumb...
Detroit, Dearborn, Royal Oak, Hamtramck, Troy,
DOn’t forget Ann Arbor...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b5bdd2c4-163c-4cfe-95ad-eef6d15518e5">
      <Text>Petoskey</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="6e820e8d-41f5-46a7-b5f6-5d22be04b8af">
      <Text>Welcome to Michigan.
Are you feeling lost?
Don’t forget to use the hand...
so put your right palm up...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e6c61601-2b20-4ebd-9087-7fd67bd4bf14">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="69dfd163-ce3d-4b18-80c9-e56cf3c4d741">
      <Text>Or face your left hand down...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="876ca908-46b1-44fa-8703-bcffb95e4c01">
      <Text>PetosKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="aadf44df-fd11-412a-ba1a-103a6339e0c2">
      <Text>Put your right palm up...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1544944b-838f-4ac6-b9b1-fb09a4d42277">
      <Text>Petoskey</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="3806cb97-93cf-4f29-bf05-805f54dbe462">
      <Text>And your left hand over...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dde5f004-c942-4cde-aae5-27ee5f4b35f8">
      <Text>Lulu &amp; PETOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="8d605edc-27b7-4688-90d8-f5b6a317af12">
      <Text>Let’s point to the palm...
Lansing, Okemos, Mt. Pleasant, Flint, Saginaw,
Let’s forget Grand Rapids...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2ed70140-ee7c-4ea9-9f66-51b249dfd464">
      <Text>Lulu &amp; PETOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="6141dc40-9767-4704-b8de-acbef8c51f4b">
      <Text>Now around the hand...
Traverse City, Holland, Grand Haven, Muskegon, Charlevoix...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e1725d4b-ba11-482a-b2c1-bf69522b9cf6">
      <Text>Petoskey points to himself.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1c893d77-0270-4aaf-9827-b2952229d204">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="6141dc40-9767-4704-b8de-acbef8c51f4b">
      <Text>Who could forget Petoskey...?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c84ffe1f-6df7-4710-837b-5a284aef0a04">
      <Text>PetoskEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="08589e57-3733-4f07-8484-7fa8a269330c">
      <Text>NOw to the other hand!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="540dd897-15ee-4fa4-82e2-d0bc3bf210a1">
      <Text>Lulu &amp; PETOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="08589e57-3733-4f07-8484-7fa8a269330c">
      <Text>Marquette, Escanaba, Sault Ste. Marie, Houghton, Iron Mountain...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0b50bdc8-698e-4526-86d7-0d3e10f079cd">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="08589e57-3733-4f07-8484-7fa8a269330c">
      <Text>What else did we forget?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="347fbc2c-3913-4288-94e1-2629b906983c">
      <Text>Petoskey brings out Snoopy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f9f5b810-9351-4843-9b7a-06ca0b04be3e">
      <Text>Lulu &amp; PETOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="027a7989-a01a-4436-ba6e-cbecf7120334">
      <Text>Michigan’s Adventures!
two parks for the price of one! Fun </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">fun</Text>
      <Text>!
Michigan, Upper, lower!
peninsulas for a thousand townships </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">townships</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="eb131d90-865c-47e4-96b0-d446e778a6b9">
      <Text>Lulu and Petoskey hold hand and spin one another.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8e943d5a-57ac-414d-822c-07d06d3f22bc">
      <Text>Lulu &amp; Petoskey</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="470b3c01-ac8e-4365-bae0-10ef8e1e8870">
      <Text>I love Michigan.
Don’t ever feel lost.
Remember to use your hands...
Hands come in handy!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="eb856690-b1a3-4f35-8b5f-8c2819a62116">
      <Text Style="Underline">End of “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Hands Come in Handy</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="bfda984e-c564-4342-b53d-a7ca9637fe52">
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">Scene 2</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="ff2224c8-4acc-4956-867a-17fd275c56b8">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="29" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHERRY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LIZZIE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PERRY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Int. Elk Lake House, 2022 - Day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="88cf1133-89ce-46cc-86ec-3a2420807ff6">
      <Text>Liz watches a recording of Lulu and Petoskey’s song.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="eb417a85-ff6c-40b1-b48e-e699118839fb">
      <Text>LizziE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4c88ce84-7759-415a-8922-4101a3138bbc">
      <Text>I guess Petoskey could be anywhere!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bee9e2e7-56fe-4397-8573-63226302e55e">
      <Text>Cherry and Perry check in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b3849735-ebbb-4d3f-a2f2-82a526aaac98">
      <Text>LizZIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1af2cd03-d218-4cb3-bfab-c132e8f254cc">
      <Text>Have you found my son?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="96be60ce-7744-4731-bd16-36ae32c86802">
      <Text>CherRY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5a70ed6b-bc9c-40bb-afb2-cd03b224e4f7">
      <Text>No luck.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4f4fc614-62f5-438b-abbd-d37393ec16cf">
      <Text>Perry</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="133eb483-2124-4439-b81b-f7a5bad4f8a9">
      <Text>You should’ve named him Limestone. He would’ve been easier to find.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e7a1fbfc-8b7a-4e2b-a9d9-b49f8cf4ffe1">
      <Text>LizziE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="58656f3e-921a-4ac8-8ac3-b283c11d71c0">
      <Text>Science is not helping.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3759c1b5-0b08-4f48-b01d-62d6667b7542">
      <Text>CherrY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cfb74221-1402-4734-aa25-ee2bf5637043">
      <Text>When did it ever?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="ff2224c8-4acc-4956-867a-17fd275c56b8">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="30" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Ext. Elk Lake House - Day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a1eda5c5-1d20-4950-9be7-096b94e33ee0">
      <Text>Cherry and Perry go outside to find many search parties.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="2b317a2f-acac-442b-b0d3-0eb725b26d30">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="30" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">15. “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Petoskey</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="7ceeb8b7-fb36-4c60-bda0-604d0f0f6d08"/>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="7ceeb8b7-fb36-4c60-bda0-604d0f0f6d08">
      <Text>[Presently, they search for him while Lulu tries to find him at BANH MI (“Petoskey”).]</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="eb856690-b1a3-4f35-8b5f-8c2819a62116">
      <Text Style="Underline">End of “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Petoskey</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="bfda984e-c564-4342-b53d-a7ca9637fe52">
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">Scene 3</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="ff2224c8-4acc-4956-867a-17fd275c56b8">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="30" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JASPER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Int. Banh Michigan - Day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8b8bd764-bf81-4cac-b3d7-e0d0ba45dc3f">
      <Text>Lulu enters the restaurant and sits by Jasper on the phone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4ea4ee2c-a410-4430-8ea6-20482f76388c">
      <Text>JaspER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="67f7c926-d45c-4674-a3e9-882593ea8f34">
      <Text>You won’t accept the cash prize? Fine. I’ll give you the BANH </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">MIchigan</Text>
      <Text> secret formula if you find him. Of course </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">alive</Text>
      <Text>, you sicko.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="45a883a1-16bb-4fd0-b1bf-e3ef37ff94fa">
      <Text>Jasper hangs up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2d00a145-d7d9-40d2-ab6a-87e5d911bf42">
      <Text>JaspER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6295d8b4-6958-47c0-aa55-9ec07820c17a">
      <Text>You found Petoskey?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="2b317a2f-acac-442b-b0d3-0eb725b26d30">
      <SceneProperties Length="1" Page="30" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JASPER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LIZZIE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LULU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LULU &amp; JASPER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">16. “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">North South East West</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0ac8f328-0fa4-4c21-8b44-ea091c47ae2a">
      <Text>Lulu faces down on the table, crying.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d92c8b14-ce21-4c67-bd45-a35e4fd9e86c">
      <Text>JaspER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e401d35c-fd55-4981-a7ef-35791e516291">
      <Text>Don’t lose yourself, Lulu...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="69d3f9a5-7701-446d-8879-3c1946b997b6">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5500362f-c06f-4137-80db-a8020a81ddc5">
      <Text>I lost my cousin. I lost my family. I lost all hope.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="7ceeb8b7-fb36-4c60-bda0-604d0f0f6d08">
      <Text>[Jasper shares his refugee family stayed united despite continents dividing them as well as a time when a Lebanese family bought out his family’s failing restaurant but did not resort to blame as Petey had. The </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Vandams</Text>
      <Text> are only divided by peninsulas. Lulu realizes Petoskey is most likely at the Mackinac Bridge (“North South East West”).]</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="eb856690-b1a3-4f35-8b5f-8c2819a62116">
      <Text Style="Underline">End of “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">North South East West</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="78e39458-698c-4318-913f-d08a0df4a211">
      <Text>Liz enters the restaurant.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1cfa436f-d54d-45ef-ae65-4b20a02a40ca">
      <Text>Lulu &amp; Jasper</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="276a9b40-ab1e-47b6-82e4-d27457eb8c8b">
      <Text>We know where Petoskey is.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e793b374-e9ea-45b5-a9e4-028a34d53af7">
      <Text>Lizzie</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f09e42c3-ed5c-4a2d-8362-e695a52482f1">
      <Text>I have a feeling, it’s...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="255f85b2-dbf7-4c86-a758-f6e8ecee48cb">
      <Text>JASPER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3c46f1c2-da99-43eb-acc6-2673234d2ec8">
      <Text>The bridge...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="78aed66d-60e7-4aa2-8cc4-63b8d4b69d9d">
      <Text>LIZZIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ecc9085a-6c59-4880-8a64-e3542fee1a4b">
      <Text>I...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b425b079-b186-4053-8b15-344cb6ec2570">
      <Text>JasPER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="541ab841-63c4-406f-8531-4d4441df5d8e">
      <Text>I’ll go to Mackinac for you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c1a3d283-47c5-4236-87de-04942af9c3d0">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d5291259-3b82-45a3-8b63-19205d24566a">
      <Text>And I need to go apologize...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0482a0a1-29eb-4489-add7-1b09c6d2b5bd">
      <Text>Liz punches her hand into her other hand. Lulu acknowledges it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7e7bbeee-2632-4901-9cd5-686c75bb82ec">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a5ae1872-fea2-438e-b741-af1b72ddb8c2">
      <Text>Apologize with some deserved violence.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bd470467-f960-4685-90d9-ebf0c8b1071e">
      <Text>Lulu and Jasper run out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="bfda984e-c564-4342-b53d-a7ca9637fe52">
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">Scene 4</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="ff2224c8-4acc-4956-867a-17fd275c56b8">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="31" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Ext. Mackinac Bridge - Day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="9db8ffae-33d8-4f33-9d0f-55621098fec0">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="31" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PETOSKEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">17. “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Rock Bottom</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e0299ee3-7520-45be-af7d-678c6121e84a">
      <Text>Petoskey</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f1e9fb25-4a23-4a7a-816c-2ad7fcb5b110">
      <Text>...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="7ceeb8b7-fb36-4c60-bda0-604d0f0f6d08"/>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="7ceeb8b7-fb36-4c60-bda0-604d0f0f6d08">
      <Text>[They drive up to find him. She offers the broken stone as a truce, but he tosses it into the water (“Rock Bottom”). This causes the bridge to fog up where his father’s ghost emerges as a giant elk. Petey shares that stones are special only when rocks are packed together. Like family, rocks come and go to leave a mark (“Family’s in the Fossils”).</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="bfda984e-c564-4342-b53d-a7ca9637fe52">
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">Scene 5</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="ff2224c8-4acc-4956-867a-17fd275c56b8">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="31" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Ext. Elk Rapids - Day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="9db8ffae-33d8-4f33-9d0f-55621098fec0">
      <SceneProperties Length="4" Page="32" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHERRY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="COP">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="FORD">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JACOB">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JASPER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LIBERTY &amp; BAILEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LIZZIE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LULU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LULU &amp; PETOSKEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MILLY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="OLIGARCH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="OLIGARCHS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PERRY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PETOSKEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RESIDENT">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RESIDENTS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SHELBY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="VANDAMS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WAYLAND">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WAYLAND &amp; OLIGARCHS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">19. “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Leave No Stones Unturned</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="56dd9fd7-dd56-44dd-b645-2d3f0f3f6470"/>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="56dd9fd7-dd56-44dd-b645-2d3f0f3f6470">
      <Text>[They return to the fair where Wayland is exhibiting data center models with other developers. Petoskey offers the Ford which she scoffs but is interested in. Jasper then offers his restaurant and golf course. The </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Vandams</Text>
      <Text> return with decades of themed costume while Wayland shows how much “better” AI is.]</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="909ea025-f493-480c-9399-54cf37036bf5">
      <Text>WayLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b4b18e4e-5a98-4692-98fd-0b5aa6f1cd5c">
      <Text>Look at them. Using their own humanity to bring messy creativity to the world. What a shame.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d5c4a2f7-aa03-425c-a81d-3f5ee46c2762">
      <Text>Resident</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dc826c99-bd41-4428-8635-372d8a3c1c19">
      <Text Style="Italic">What</Text>
      <Text> a shame? It’s </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">who</Text>
      <Text> and that’s you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6bfd2adf-75a7-495a-9318-af34a0234e96">
      <Text>WAYLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2e021143-5375-42fe-8367-057f60d62fe4">
      <Text>Me? The shame would be on me if I leave the city of stones unturned.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6c95849e-4381-4ae0-8722-93cca283d7c0">
      <Text>RESIDENT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e89273bd-411f-44c7-b333-ccc87434044a">
      <Text>We don’t need another city turned into a data center.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f6f00a60-d4bb-4f24-b189-dbf14858c21f">
      <Text>Residents</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="06f1f45c-ceaa-4a1c-99b3-8e6957407007">
      <Text>Yeah!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f6014b83-d5ed-482e-8875-8d34d766fd86">
      <Text>WaYLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a6df4507-23c3-4b62-9552-aefbcc47ff8e">
      <Text>Data Rapids has a nice ring to it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="050b199b-c8a8-483d-bda5-24286da13a91">
      <Text>RESIDENT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7065d3ae-17f2-42af-948a-55ad5ebbcb2b">
      <Text>The </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Vandam</Text>
      <Text> is our ring...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7b0517d6-efba-4894-a064-4d5e59cf41b0">
      <Text>Resident</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e5d2339f-e72b-49a5-83b1-6a25ab39d7af">
      <Text>And we’re committed to them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a5d75491-d180-434c-96aa-5e502c6ba76e">
      <Text>RESIDENT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e2774fcc-f945-48a8-ab7a-b9bf2fe6b38b">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Vandams</Text>
      <Text>! </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Vandams</Text>
      <Text>! </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Vandams</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0a9f3d80-6731-4201-a17d-bf66f60d0845">
      <Text>Wayland</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c3292d17-0af5-4433-a32e-e75f93d52ec5">
      <Text>Activate Elk dot AI!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="414029a0-0a67-4d98-a381-3b32f2750589">
      <Text>Everyone’s phone pings. They get distracted.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="35993d3c-7576-4fb7-8893-d9b669fc69d6">
      <Text>ReSIDENT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3af18d8a-163a-4cdd-8d2b-056a48e159bd">
      <Text>Check out this cute elk doing karate!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e075c197-637c-4e11-a0cd-45f5d1bad147">
      <Text>Resident</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="43ea5731-3e16-4f01-b4d8-9c9bbda5a9ee">
      <Text>My elk is doing a comedy routine!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="36ce8954-94b2-4b7a-ae4c-ffc2334f7a53">
      <Text>RESIDENT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9e4d29b3-d75c-40b7-b74b-1e3d6d7f79fe">
      <Text>And this is Aretha Franklin as an elk!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="24aa3abf-37fb-46a9-b21e-2e8f52fac9b6">
      <Text>Wayland and the Oligarchs make their way through the distracted crowd to the Ford Model T.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d69bc687-3a16-4708-a752-be19d4f4f883">
      <Text>Lulu and Petoskey block Wayland.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a9cf8bb0-1b6a-4551-a6d2-6e7132007b03">
      <Text>PetosKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7586d5fd-3311-47eb-84e2-22ea980c33e4">
      <Text>We don’t have our phones.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="57cc1ac3-913f-451e-8e56-0f3fc12c3d04">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="87baac4e-aab8-478a-9428-3a4c00e2895f">
      <Text>Our parents grounded us.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="47785f82-82c1-4d3e-8c06-bae68272e6aa">
      <Text>Holding a frying pan, Milly sneaks behind Wayland and the oligarchs. She knocks them out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0ee6b880-8ae0-420c-8d67-27e9851eb63d">
      <Text>Lulu &amp; PETOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1fcf0374-5b45-424d-864a-1d383c8ac9e9">
      <Text>Grammy Milly!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="469c3a9c-a844-43a1-84a8-91e8d102f109">
      <Text>Lulu and Petoskey go to hug Milly. She stops them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="05be859d-b203-4294-b719-ded77056d184">
      <Text>Milly</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dd427ab1-9b64-4142-b83e-cd5797ca92fa">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Ope</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">ope</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">ope</Text>
      <Text>... You need baths. But first, want me wipe a batch of your favorite cookies?! I don’t want your dirty butts in the backseat, so get in the trunk.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e1504dd1-fb55-4de3-a349-310e873908e5">
      <Text>LULU &amp; PETOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8268230c-d59e-4b50-ac11-ecb4b4914474">
      <Text>Anything for you, Grammy!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e62e3b50-d6b6-46b1-8044-1125a5eeb665">
      <Text>Lulu and Petoskey get in the trunk. Milly closes it then vanishes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e62e3b50-d6b6-46b1-8044-1125a5eeb665">
      <Text>Wayland and the Oligarchs get up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1dc7a26b-6cc7-43c0-95d8-44bec1982889">
      <Text>WayLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1685212b-131e-4946-8994-d05100446a48">
      <Text>Works every time...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cda32c83-b81c-4c1c-85cb-e03afeebad14">
      <Text>The residents face Wayland.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d919a307-059c-47cb-8820-4e182bbb915d">
      <Text>Vandams</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e1eef13f-f741-4aec-95ed-b469ca32d92d">
      <Text>Those wealth hoarders are kidnapping our kids!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7b25a16a-bfbf-4182-b30f-fc5cd134e2aa">
      <Text>Residents</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="20dab41e-ccc4-4a46-8a57-a5cfe15b0ce1">
      <Text>Get them!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="058363e5-3ec4-46b5-910a-ae76822b916e">
      <Text>The Ford Model T drives away from the pursuing crowd.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4f47fa1b-dfb9-4c56-9f16-67012821e0d9">
      <Text>Oligarch</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e3902c8d-666d-4860-8750-3ef99609b44a">
      <Text>Is it morally right to lock kids in the trunk?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4aef776f-e635-4e66-aea8-2bf3220a05b7">
      <Text>Oligarch</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cff7305e-b0fd-48eb-877e-47cccee0c898">
      <Text>We can sell them for parts!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4651d731-88de-44a6-aa93-0078b2d74320">
      <Text>OLIGARCH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="37ac340e-bfc3-4c92-ae21-e8c1ad23b728">
      <Text>I love being rich!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="91097284-690b-4647-a9b9-f2beb09ed45f">
      <Text>WaylAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="274fec22-4777-4b9c-9755-0ac27e7010fd">
      <Text>Elk Rapids, check. Next, Grand Rapids!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7ea08e50-f757-4225-a10f-87d9262ba107">
      <Text>The ghost of Henry Ford manifests inside the Ford Model T, chained up like a Charles Dickens ghost.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e1961b64-8c02-435a-abb9-c653249fad89">
      <Text>WayLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6bfe1563-52df-40d5-b342-e21c3537582d">
      <Text>The ghost of Henry Ford???!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="36a2ef38-9f30-42ab-8626-51541376e43b">
      <Text>Oligarchs</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a2f08861-7cc0-476b-938f-bab54284d71a">
      <Text>Our lord and savior...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="14717864-d4f2-4e6b-9cc6-f3387ebb0539">
      <Text>WAYLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="039ca583-2f5f-4c55-b1a5-8ce2b0280af2">
      <Text>What happened to you?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cc19ef4a-b525-4ca5-a1ec-8a69cc79b919">
      <Text>Ford</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e3659754-1ce4-4944-aee6-ae9934fcc251">
      <Text>This is what anti-Semitism and being anti-union does to you. Distribute your wealth or else!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9ed3bc23-4527-4f5a-b004-89ed968be74a">
      <Text>OliGARCH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="16ae900b-8adf-4329-84c8-a3a2dd81d265">
      <Text>Well, at least there’s cryptocurrency.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5e27fc41-acfe-485e-9648-59f6a2eba6ab">
      <Text>Ford</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="02fc59c5-2848-4b3d-a1d6-8babeab1c14e">
      <Text>We have the internet in Hell, too. You think angels invented </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">WIFI</Text>
      <Text>?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f56f2acf-818c-48b0-9990-f64c7184bf20">
      <Text>WayLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f3ec3da7-abd9-4ba0-a1ae-fba2e8a63718">
      <Text>Get off my plane of existence!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2c93b643-57de-4c14-a8e9-c1bc26aac666">
      <Text>Wayland drives off a bridge.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="75ce2ed4-185a-4740-a0a4-8be13d9cdb28">
      <Text>The </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Vandams</Text>
      <Text> and the townspeople reach the wreckage.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ea72ef43-d7cb-4fcb-9d90-5ebe6f373440">
      <Text>LizzIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b51247b0-67b8-446d-9c30-77acaa80642e">
      <Text>Driving off bridges is not the best idea. But you ain’t alone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="283c4334-0666-4195-a9c9-1f3e50e3a210">
      <Text>WAYLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="959132cd-e5de-43e6-96ed-4162625bfc9b">
      <Text>The ghost of Ford is here!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ab959131-2fe4-4f58-826a-d45edf0b23e7">
      <Text>Residents</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="224b48a7-78bb-4d1c-a580-c62df91311d0">
      <Text>Gerald R. Ford?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9ac0466d-9a1f-4a64-bb27-f557ff3d8bf7">
      <Text>WAYLAND &amp; Oligarchs</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a0beb911-6dcb-4902-b90f-d2fc08cce8a6">
      <Text>Henry!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="788c1fda-63d1-46e0-a692-75eef151bed3">
      <Text>Residents</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d52f3b6c-0dc7-4902-84a3-65a84df2f2cd">
      <Text>They’re insane...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="846f329e-a31e-4ce7-9842-e9f1b1211ffa">
      <Text>The cops arrest Wayland and the oligarchs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="40ea0d8e-04b3-478b-a1a7-86d7fa257522">
      <Text>Cherry</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f7764ad3-de13-4728-b92a-b44246f8eb8b">
      <Text>Cops arresting oligarchs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="55a7f8d1-2bc2-479b-8e60-2ca7d147c319">
      <Text>Perry</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5de6679e-b703-47d5-a169-4fc8015398cf">
      <Text>This ain’t real life.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="33410b7d-e30b-42b1-901e-6802ced42e5a">
      <Text>Shelby</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="32b98c12-87ef-498b-b95b-fb4e8800d782">
      <Text>There’s a reason.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8ab739f9-eb41-4979-a828-02eed6653efa">
      <Text>Cop</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f9dc4018-0cf3-498d-9c5a-0254aca78d15">
      <Text>We’ve always been arresting the mentally ill.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7f22b13d-f37e-4bcf-ba0b-f8ef41ff6c6f">
      <Text>Jacob</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a340ce2c-3d69-4573-9d7e-27e2f2184520">
      <Text>And you’re gonna throw them in an asylum without due process?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6b72c13f-9bcc-4e08-a969-9807d7a3b973">
      <Text>COP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="986c2c55-f1dc-41c6-ab6d-f48101401757">
      <Text>Yup. That ain’t gonna change.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fde6b978-4cfd-41bd-af21-744ab4e6f08b">
      <Text>LIBERTY &amp; BAILEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="968056ee-e42c-42d7-baf4-d3f77a8dbd34">
      <Text Style="Italic">Excellent</Text>
      <Text>. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Muahahaha</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="185c79de-5a27-42e1-b217-2e581db67ec3">
      <Text>JASPER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0628256e-79c5-4d14-92b3-40ff81d6b584">
      <Text>Technically, once their party is declared insane, it voids their contracts after they have held this entire city hostage.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="db5804ad-ba92-493c-afb2-c186ba1e10ae">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">VanDAMS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="139a7b2d-dd25-454c-9ffd-5f3ce6b649f7">
      <Text>The lake house is ours!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2673f762-299d-4de4-82f8-edfbfb8b7734">
      <Text>Residents</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="80f24814-6a48-4cde-b1bb-839d7af7704a">
      <Text>All our houses are back!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="95beeec9-eb70-4ab1-8715-303bddbc81fa">
      <Text>Lulu and Petoskey are still in the trunk of the Ford Model T.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3e16a278-e221-4476-99b8-41534619b68b">
      <Text>Lulu &amp; PETOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="139a7b2d-dd25-454c-9ffd-5f3ce6b649f7">
      <Text>Elk Rapids! Elk Rapids!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="33eaf8ee-db4c-4e2c-9386-d505682f23c4">
      <Text>Liz and Shelby open the trunk, releasing Lulu and Petoskey.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9814f28f-168a-4a40-9928-c6c2f867d039">
      <Text>Residents</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="96a8d5e4-8b41-4e50-b2f2-85aa729e2f27">
      <Text>Hurray! Lulu and Petoskey! Lulu and Petoskey!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6b576334-5f84-45e2-9f9f-14115b11e918">
      <Text>The </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Vandams</Text>
      <Text> and the townspeople rally around Lulu and Petoskey.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5f6cbbd9-8564-415a-9c4a-9728684d2c23">
      <Text>Lulu &amp; PETOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="99999cd9-cc97-43d9-8d7b-00e4affbef78">
      <Text>Let’s celebrate at BANH </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">MIchigan</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ced0f318-6325-487d-af48-690f73e585c8">
      <Text>Everyone leaves Lulu and Petoskey.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="eb856690-b1a3-4f35-8b5f-8c2819a62116">
      <Text Style="Underline">End of “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Leave No Stones Unturned</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="bfda984e-c564-4342-b53d-a7ca9637fe52">
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">Scene 6</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="ff2224c8-4acc-4956-867a-17fd275c56b8">
      <SceneProperties Length="2 2/8" Page="36" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="FORD">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JACOB">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JASPER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LIBERTY &amp; BAILEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LIZZIE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LULU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LULU &amp; PETOSKEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PETOSKEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="VANDAMS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WILLY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Ext. Elk Lake House - Day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f5db0eaa-f477-40b3-b0bc-3a52268b93fd">
      <Text>Lulu goes sit by Elk Lake and drop her rocks as Petoskey watches.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f5db0eaa-f477-40b3-b0bc-3a52268b93fd">
      <Text>Jasper takes down the last tent while the sisters toss candy at him in admiration.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0d916a51-1ff1-4ff8-b9b1-ea4acfea87b3">
      <Text>Jasper</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3223a259-87a0-423a-86dc-96a5c0cdb115">
      <Text>There’s ‘</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">nough</Text>
      <Text> sweets to go around... with kid representation upon dad taxation.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="391f7f8a-e651-461a-9f9c-618c7d55b92d">
      <Text>LIZZIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bce5b65d-a20d-4549-8229-e184b6ea88e5">
      <Text>And mom taxation!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c820d1ac-bd2e-42d1-aaa0-ecc8e4d1dd46">
      <Text>Liz nabs candy from Jasper’s hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cb610201-8d66-4e36-a1ad-8ac8480c6abc">
      <Text>LibERTY &amp; BAILEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2ead47bb-f093-46dc-8d0f-80d8d999cf78">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Grampy</Text>
      <Text> Willy, can we have some candy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1862a338-8434-4a78-a1d2-73bc72223da0">
      <Text>Willy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="42d120e8-7680-4aa7-85d8-4a8edebcd0e4">
      <Text>I’m Willy. Not Willy Wonka. Ask them two tax collectors over there.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bc5b3206-3b32-4c29-8bbd-1187a702a0d5">
      <Text>As wild beasts, the Twins eye Liz and Jasper. They chase them out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3e76d19e-2543-4408-9e7a-4bf648a2dcce">
      <Text>Petoskey joins Lulu by Elk Lake.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a004da94-d77a-42d9-a365-48adc9c1246e">
      <Text>PetoskEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3bda011c-ec2a-4e24-bfce-2237ff5440e5">
      <Text>The reigning champion of this year’s rock competition. By a landslide.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="59079a7c-6674-422b-b97f-6b07a28e197e">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3aeba2e0-b7d5-4e15-92cf-2e7519f139db">
      <Text>I got help from an Elk. Wanna help skip them?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f1a850a8-4b6e-43ed-85ff-ca107e8e6828">
      <Text Style="Bold">Audience Engagement:</Text>
      <Text> Petoskey and Lulu face the audience. They toss rocks until someone yells: “Ow!”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f239cf78-38a3-49f3-a4ac-09af6e88aa02">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2700ce81-0b7e-43f3-98f1-e539d3c5639d">
      <Text>Oh dear!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ba7767d4-3df0-443c-8d08-2065bee58404">
      <Text>PetoSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="701feb0d-a252-400a-a0fb-33fe8b2d6ad7">
      <Text>Someone’s swimming here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a5594171-17cb-4e94-ad04-7293860ab96c">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="c595b98f-0cab-4dcc-9f4d-303f6daa3c4a">
      <Text>(Canadian)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="212d986c-cc32-407c-8f99-bfb485cb7238">
      <Text Style="Italic">Sorry</Text>
      <Text>, eh.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b23d0bdb-068d-499f-8f37-29fa6f530134">
      <Text>PETOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0d5072a8-70ec-4d7a-b6b5-84b2cd58e398">
      <Text>Rocky start.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dc8a01fd-cc3c-48c6-af46-7787a40f8508">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f54a843e-657d-4bf7-92a8-9ffbaae49bea">
      <Text>Rocky end.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="163a904e-7691-4724-a7de-6f857e66a23a">
      <Text>Lulu &amp; PETOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3dd043cc-f825-4fed-9248-2b2000b58b0b">
      <Text>Wouldn’t want it any other way.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="18008e50-0fd8-40c9-a605-667ead687d6e">
      <Text>Lulu and Petoskey hug.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3947faa2-528d-49af-bbd8-5b0f0faf105e">
      <Text>Jacob stumbles in with his phone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="368e2e2d-577c-4810-8ed0-c5216b84369a">
      <Text>Jacob</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e7b41772-9aea-4574-bb24-8c798dff2876">
      <Text>Guys and dolls! Guess what?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b03d171b-5954-4b3c-9213-1233d067d515">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">VanDAMS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="11c47a75-c0f8-4847-9261-5a2bbcadb8f0">
      <Text>What?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2626f424-120b-465e-b28b-2f07d3cdaee0">
      <Text>JACOB</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4f98156f-a800-447c-ad18-cd7c28b95881">
      <Text>O K! </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fba9ebde-720f-453b-9f26-ff27ace26aa5">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">VandaMS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f26950c5-737a-4884-8cd6-39315f52d7fa">
      <Text>Oklahoma? Where the wind comes sweeping down the plain? You’re moving there?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="897ddfac-5923-4778-aa74-6f8a12e25b44">
      <Text>JACOB</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4f98156f-a800-447c-ad18-cd7c28b95881">
      <Text>No </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">no</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">no</Text>
      <Text>. I’m joining the revival of </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">Oklahoma</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6231e67f-ea68-44b3-8bfd-98113f0304dc">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d9fe1830-8c98-488d-8e2a-914aa7051c3f">
      <Text>As long as you’re not Jud Fry.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bb41bffd-b5cb-4ff3-b85b-c9c784e91529">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">VandaMS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="0c3be0f3-a17f-4ba5-82f4-bbdde69a390d">
      <Text>(staring down Petoskey)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7b18b3ce-a1e3-48df-a648-ea97ce24b146">
      <Text>Yeah, that guy </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">succckkkkkkssssss</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="596a68d7-47c6-49da-9763-f980ce4c5d37">
      <Text>PetoSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f5b4a666-a2d5-47d9-b8cf-d1022cc633ce">
      <Text>Mom, I think the Trolls have ‘</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">nough</Text>
      <Text> of us...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="730f684b-a799-4e30-9a92-399c88ae72a8">
      <Text>LizzIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f33c2228-ff20-4e8b-a472-f89b17ce3348">
      <Text>Before we make a run for it... Willy, may I take the Model T for a spin?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4afb57fd-5a80-471d-aeb3-256eb919d2f8">
      <Text>WillY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ca249bfc-14f4-416f-a5fe-094ff16d8ded">
      <Text>Drive it off another bridge and Henry Ford will roll in his grave.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="26b84913-8db8-4da2-b3ff-232d856348dc">
      <Text>Henry Ford manifests.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="12eaee53-a369-4544-9f3c-65b90f1eaca0">
      <Text>Ford</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="01a62ab1-fabb-4d00-8305-6eae3c7e0eed">
      <Text>You have my blessing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4b0a71ee-4b0e-413f-a8ef-bba826ca3f49">
      <Text>Lulu and the Twins spot Ford. They chase out the ghost of Henry Ford.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5c1a8820-41c1-4515-bbad-3b5c8cdbc54e">
      <Text>Liberty &amp; Bailey</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7d625667-2821-4122-a4be-6e101d1017f5">
      <Text>See you in Hell, Henry Ford!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9e01f530-a484-4fef-9a44-8ad4d1670c52">
      <Text>PetosKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="917ba699-a613-4c43-ac2d-9a3dd037a365">
      <Text>Told ya they ain’t angels.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a485c620-ef65-4654-b799-5ae56a53661a">
      <Text>LizzIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="afb59960-891a-4a93-bfb0-0e7efcb7a3e3">
      <Text>They have inner demons they need to face...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f6968e55-92f9-46ff-af3c-83edd0e29a94">
      <Text>Liz starts up the Ford Model T. Petoskey hops in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a0bab618-533a-46d4-a349-2524a177b9fc">
      <Text>LiZZIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c579bea8-4e6b-44ee-8a55-84cfdc74f94b">
      <Text>Son... We’re taking the shortcut.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="20fab989-0b24-40a0-bd3a-c84ddd4c2895">
      <Text>Liz and Petoskey wave bye to all.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="bfda984e-c564-4342-b53d-a7ca9637fe52">
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">Scene 7</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="ff2224c8-4acc-4956-867a-17fd275c56b8">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="38" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Ext. Mackinac Bridge - Day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="5da96831-1e73-4f5e-baff-daeadd78b157">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 3/8" Page="38" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LIZZIE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LIZZIE &amp; PETEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MACKINAC GHOSTS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PETEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">20. “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Water to My Soul</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="124a05bc-4ca1-4408-8b27-15546de56622">
      <Text>On the foggy bridge is the broken Petoskey necklace.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="124a05bc-4ca1-4408-8b27-15546de56622">
      <Text>Liz drives towards the outskirts of the bridge. She motions for Petoskey to stay put. She walks alone on the bridge.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="eff72c73-374e-41dc-b933-f9b7709d4f3b">
      <Text>LizzIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="48515167-0857-41ec-84e9-10fe27ee41a3">
      <Text>When? When? When? When?
When will I ever let go?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="73560b01-4ceb-425d-9a02-1f30ab4fb8d9">
      <Text>MACKINAC GHOSTS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="0089c618-e22a-4135-a72f-763aa5292ef8">
      <Text>When you open your eyes and see the pain show...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="f8798372-662b-4441-ac22-c47ff6286629">
      <DualDialogue>
        <SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
          <IgnoredRanges/>
          <IgnoredWords/>
        </SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="004b0147-403c-4bbd-bf9a-f8df7e3834bd">
          <Text>LizzIE</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="07526105-5aad-4713-bb5f-313efe9b08f7">
          <Text>Where? Where? Where? Where?
Where do all my tears flow?</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6a05474b-4bc0-42fd-a8a0-86b2c5cfd582">
          <Text>MacKINAC GHOSTS</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="661f859c-dea4-4c2a-9433-050b21c2a77c">
          <Text>Where? Where?
Flow?</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </DualDialogue>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="93ca3943-84c4-465d-9891-2811fb9b0f2c">
      <Text>The ghosts step aside to reveal Petey in all his glory.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="de20546b-fdc3-47aa-afb9-39597fcaaeab">
      <Text>MackINAC GHOSTS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="8c991dac-2129-4f80-8ee2-d5a0ce763be7">
      <Text>Well you just have to ask this poor soul...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="28941325-62a6-49a2-b0f5-cf13966c32f0">
      <DualDialogue>
        <SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
          <IgnoredRanges/>
          <IgnoredWords/>
        </SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="27cf90bf-7b17-45b2-b40e-8be825134027">
          <Text>LizZIE</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="4e5c057f-960a-4635-9533-c4f052e1f460">
          <Text>My poor soul...</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="52253b3e-fc28-472a-81ec-cbce861722f0">
          <Text>PETEY</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="71ba7d2c-e6c8-4f26-b042-ce2dd443ce7f">
          <Text>Now a happy soul...</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </DualDialogue>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b688b443-7f46-49a8-a9e1-268b46481ee0">
      <Text>LizzIE &amp; PETEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="e1db36e0-b4fd-4cae-801a-20a89ad0803b">
      <Text>You are water to my soul...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8f43c2d8-a625-40fd-abda-f81c8424f0b3">
      <Text>LizzIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="a43b88ec-2db7-43c9-914a-de485612e9fd">
      <Text>Where you go.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c43f5f9e-a16f-4e04-81ae-a49213d5fc94">
      <Text>PetEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="fdcaf25b-fbfb-41ce-9f85-2e97788fc801">
      <Text>I’ll flow!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6c4ad8df-039e-49fd-92af-356fb84c58eb">
      <Text>MacKINAC GHOSTS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="88f183af-c077-48be-9a38-3bf3d0e65894">
      <Text>No matter where I go I will flow...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f57fcc00-55c0-46c6-a43c-c65ddbf25f6f">
      <Text>LizzIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="930532db-153d-400a-aaa9-316ba815465e">
      <Text>Upstream.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7048a56b-0ffd-4822-b1a5-30ce5285e1bd">
      <Text>PeteY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="87c2f648-b3ae-4dbb-8ef5-c3d01994cd5b">
      <Text>Downstream.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7dd92ae0-a094-45dd-ac5d-cd225fd4ab5b">
      <Text>MackINAC GHOSTS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="c9c0aa08-cc14-4f24-99a8-a9d300f5b89c">
      <Text>You are water to my soul...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6cfdf796-2e38-44ed-9aa7-c8e4f58cfc57">
      <Text>Liz and Petey kiss.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6da09e9d-30b9-43bd-aaef-8570fd0dd0d2">
      <Text>LizzIE &amp; PETEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="0933a8f7-a700-47c9-876d-0eb4e04c604a">
      <Text>You are water to my soul...
My soul...
You are my soul!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1168109f-e55c-4035-b297-0ebc7623c043">
      <Text>They share a final dance before he hands his broken Petoskey necklace to her. She joins Petoskey.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="241af24e-6a71-488d-994a-f5575ddd68ca">
      <Text>Liz and Petoskey wave as Petey vanishes with the other ghosts once more into the foggy bridge.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="73b241ea-c945-4493-abe7-bc45ac5eed3a">
      <Text>Liz puts the Petey’s heirloom necklace over Petoskey.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="002e9850-f324-45aa-9938-de3311064e4b">
      <Text>They finally cross the bridge.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="eb856690-b1a3-4f35-8b5f-8c2819a62116">
      <Text Style="Underline">End of “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Water to My Soul</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="End of Act" id="4cf2ff73-d51b-45e2-ba40-17be8bb1c533">
      <Text>End of Act </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">II</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Label="Scene 1" Type="New Act" id="03254032-ba6b-4137-a15f-5226dbf7d214">
      <Text>Act </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">III</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="c4991dc9-c78e-42e1-985d-061b649af3c4">
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">Scene 1</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="987c3cbc-adb0-4eed-895f-9c2ec73d05c3">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="40" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Ext. Elk Rapids, 2037 - Day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="5da96831-1e73-4f5e-baff-daeadd78b157">
      <SceneProperties Length="1" Page="40" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LIZZIE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="VANDAMS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">20. “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Life is Complete - Reprise 2</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c0c40aea-e0d9-4490-95c9-07f4aabb71b6">
      <Text>The </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Vandams</Text>
      <Text> prepare themselves for the Harbor Days Grande Parade.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b6c26630-b396-4071-848b-98ded47ef376">
      <Text>LizzIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="880d795c-a4fe-42d8-86b8-bece8c050467">
      <Text>(Narrating)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="66f5df2b-7785-462d-90a1-2e871cb25268">
      <Text>Year after year, we still do Harbor Days. Every time, I’m there. I’m able to cross bridge. Yay me, facing my trauma. Huh...

And Lulu ended up turning our life story into a musical for her high school senior year project then she went to U of M...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a59b64cf-0afd-4ae4-84a0-4b05994acea3">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Vandams</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ac23f451-016f-453a-9e3a-444fe52703e5">
      <Text>Ew...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="06a54fc9-d3ea-4597-a6c2-b71758868f81">
      <Text>Lulu flips them off before turning her hand back into a mitten.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="356e5c29-b8d7-49c7-b2f6-88a3eb27ed07">
      <Text>LizZIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8fae8a86-203b-41c4-a853-8ef96ec5754a">
      <Text>And “Elk Rapids” the musical is now touring in a town near you. This musical helped raise funds to make Willy’s lake house ours when the time came when Willy is no longer was with us.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cc4526fd-77a2-4473-933a-4b5534bd718d">
      <Text>Lulu and Petoskey fix up the lake house.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="517a680b-f9b7-4903-8744-8659c2de72ff">
      <Text>LizzIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ab77ffe1-1132-4955-8092-dcde25c484bc">
      <Text>Petoskey worked the shipyard much like me and his father. And he used that trade skill to fix up the lake house. So long as Amanda Wayland never gets a patch of grass of Elk Rapids, it’s a win for us.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="73bda2ea-a266-4007-be91-57815e50130b">
      <Text>Cherry secretly pulls out her tablet. She puts a photo of Willy and Milly on it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="18f9c281-693a-4003-baa2-c1a785af6ac1">
      <Text>Willy and Milly manifest.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="19251e1a-255e-4320-ad1b-3ed68d6907f1">
      <Text>Cherry waves. Perry and Shelby run in and mess with Cherry.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="59ea03ae-7c13-4338-b72c-e92d25e6a0ea">
      <Text>The </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Vandams</Text>
      <Text> come together and view the Great Lakes together.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d2ffe695-e600-4a8a-8911-9631f17a2d56">
      <Text>Lizzie</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="09625700-0615-494d-8513-f968e2322ad5">
      <Text>The Great Lakes is water to our souls...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="eb856690-b1a3-4f35-8b5f-8c2819a62116">
      <Text Style="Underline">End of “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Life is Complete - Reprise 2</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="c4991dc9-c78e-42e1-985d-061b649af3c4">
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">Scene 2</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="5da96831-1e73-4f5e-baff-daeadd78b157">
      <SceneProperties Length="6/8" Page="41" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JACOB">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">21. “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Michigan</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1945bc54-6800-4649-9321-3c741873592f">
      <Text>The Harbor Days Grande Parade ramps up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1945bc54-6800-4649-9321-3c741873592f">
      <Text>Jacob is dressed like Eminem.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bdfb5b6e-8dbc-4e61-a33e-d339dced62e9">
      <Text>JacOB</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="34f41eb3-4ead-4d0b-814d-45317af41482">
      <Text>My palms be sweaty, knees weak, arms are heavy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b29b7aec-d2a7-4aa6-abbe-a4ba5b873c9c">
      <Text>Cherry hands spaghetti to Jacob.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="da02ad70-a198-4f69-8336-a01cf4d68f41">
      <Text>Jacob</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6ac4e8e9-b08e-4a10-82c6-b7fd923d517f">
      <Text>That’s mom with my spaghetti!

Welcome to Harbor Days! Thank you for inviting me back as your Grand Marshall. I’ve returned after hosting 2022’s. Since then, I have won several Tony Awards and Razzies. Them cameras make my hands look big.

</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Anywho</Text>
      <Text>, as you know, Michigan officially became the 26th state in the United States on January 26, 1837. As this year is the 200th anniversary of our statehood, we thought what better way to celebrate the Great Lakes then to share the best of our home state! Today is Pure Michigan!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="3f17ab61-612a-49e3-9487-211ddd6a8498"/>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="3f17ab61-612a-49e3-9487-211ddd6a8498">
      <Text>[For the 2037 Harbor Days which celebrates two hundred years of statehood (January 26, 1837), the theme is Pure Michigan where the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Vandam</Text>
      <Text> family resembles the state’s best from Eminem, Aretha Franklin, Charles Lindbergh, Madonna, Malcolm X, Rosa Parks, Stevie Wonder. They sing about Michigan and Michiganders.]</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="238fcebc-fec6-40be-93f0-bd789fcd8499">
      <Text Style="Underline">End of “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Michigan</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="End of Act" id="b233a95e-ccdc-4664-a63d-a0b4b6024669">
      <Text>End of Musical</Text>
    </Paragraph>
  </Content>

